          "type": "explanation",
          "html": "<p>Welcome to the Numbers from 11 to 20 practice!<br/><br/> In this module, you'll start counting and recognizing numbers from 11 to 20. This means that you're entering the world of larger numbers, building on your knowledge of smaller ones. <br /><br /> I want you to note on the next page that once you reach 10, all the next numbers will start with 1: 11, 12, 13, 14, 15, 16, 17, 18, 19. And only when you reach 19, the next number will start with 2: 20.<br /><br /> Have fun!</p>"
